cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this data or analysis, cite it as below and link the release version."
type: dataset
title: "TitrateLab peptide COA analysis: vendor-blind aggregates of published lab reports"
authors:
  - name: "TitrateLab"
    website: "https://titratelab.com"
version: "2026-10-12"
date-released: "2026-10-12"
url: "https://github.com/titratelab/peptide-coa-analysis"
repository-code: "https://github.com/titratelab/peptide-coa-analysis"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - peptides
  - certificate of analysis
  - COA
  - HPLC purity
  - endotoxin
  - laboratory testing
  - open data
abstract: >-
  Monthly, vendor-blind aggregates of 96,805 published peptide lab reports
  (68 compounds, 26 named laboratories,
  2022-07 to 2026-09) by compound, laboratory and month, with purity,
  quantity-versus-label, endotoxin and verifiability statistics, a manifest with coverage
  and missing-data counts, and the method behind every figure.
